    boundaries:{en:['Enrollment coordinators do not manage care, develop plans or give medical advice.','Eligibility, billing and monthly requirements must follow current payer/CMS rules.','CareCheck360 access is restricted to assigned Care Management roles.'],es:['Enrollment no maneja atención, crea planes ni da consejo médico.','Elegibilidad, facturación y requisitos mensuales siguen reglas vigentes.','CareCheck360 está restringido a roles asignados.']},
    kpis:{en:['Consent/enrollment documentation','Monthly active patient contact','Care-plan and note completion','Alert resolution','Clinical signature completion','Retention and opt-out accuracy'],es:['Consentimiento/inscripción','Contacto mensual activo','Plan y notas completas','Resolución de alertas','Firmas clínicas','Retención y bajas correctas']},sources:['CCM Enrollment Coordinator email · 2026-06-30','CareCheck360 application','Training Center · QHSLAB','CMS Care Management guidance']
